OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with showery outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain, turning heavy at times. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong northeasterly winds, easing
OL,10,Facross Orkney later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will remain cloudy
OL,13,Fthroughout the day with outbreaks of
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy rain, and fresh
OL,15,Fnortheast to northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
