OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Ffew showers at first on Thursday, soon
OL,7,Fturning drier and brighter. Dry,
OL,8,Fbright start on with rain or showers
OL,9,Flater. Dry spells and some showers on
OL,10,FSaturday.
